    <tu>
      <tuv lang="EN-US">
        <seg>LemonLDAP::NG is a free software, released under &lt;a0&gt;GPL&lt;/a0&gt; license.</seg>
      </tuv>
      <tuv lang="FR-FR">
        <seg>LemonLDAP::NG est un logiciel libre distribué sous licence &lt;a0&gt;GPL&lt;/a0&gt;.</seg>
      </tuv>
    </tu>
    <tu>
